From ec088fd4573cc77888521440b2bd8e7c818b731d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pablo Lopez <plopez@unc.edu.ar>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:42:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add modification notices for the GPL and a note about this
 fork in the README

- Each source file modified with respect to MariusCautun/DTFE now states
  that it was modified in 2026 and where (GPL v3, section 5a).
- memory_estimate.h uses the same license text as the rest of the code
  (GPL v3 or later).
- The README starts with a note saying that this is a modified,
  non-official version, where to report problems, the license and
  which papers to cite. The original README text is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C44ZCErHKsQgk681XW3FMn
